WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.688
Put these two files in order. The note is ten kilobytes. The map is forty kilobytes.

00:00:06.688 --> 00:00:13.034
Hold the smaller file and drag it above the larger file. You can also use the up arrow.

00:00:13.034 --> 00:00:18.536
Read from top to bottom. Ten comes before forty. Check the order.
